Hi Jeremy,

Thank you for providing more detail.  Now I can pinpoint the error.  I replicated your error, and the problem is that you likely created a model design matrix with empty variables.

For example

> species <- factor(rep(1:4, each = 10))
> site <- plethodon$site
>
> model.matrix( ~species * site)
   (Intercept) species2 species3 species4 siteSymp species2:siteSymp species3:siteSymp species4:siteSymp
1            1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
2            1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
3            1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
4            1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
5            1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
6            1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
7            1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
8            1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
9            1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
10           1        0        0        0        1                 0                 0                 0
11           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
12           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
13           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
14           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
15           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
16           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
17           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
18           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
19           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
20           1        1        0        0        1                 1                 0                 0
21           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
22           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
23           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
24           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
25           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
26           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
27           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
28           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
29           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
30           1        0        1        0        0                 0                 0                 0
31           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
32           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
33           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
34           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
35           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
36           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
37           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
38           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
39           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
40           1        0        0        1        0                 0                 0                 0
attr(,"assign")
[1] 0 1 1 1 2 3 3 3
attr(,"contrasts")
attr(,"contrasts")$species
[1] "contr.treatment"

attr(,"contrasts")$site
[1] "contr.treatment"

Notie the last two columns are all 0s.  This will not work in trajectory.analysis.  The error message might not be helpful to diagnose this, but it caused the same error for me that you found.

Note, if I changed the species factor above to species <- factor(rep(1:4, 10)), so that it had in order 1, 2, 3, 4, 1, 2, 3, 4, …. instead of 1,1,1,1, …., 2, 2, 2, 2, …., then the design matrix was full-rank and the analysis worked.

So now my hunch is that you have a case where at least one level of one factor is not represented in the other factor.  You can create a model matrix like I did above to check that for your data.

Cheers!
Mike

